      "description": {
        "en": "Pool coding-agent free credits (WorkBuddy/CodeBuddy, SenseNova Raccoon, Qoder, TRAE, ZCode, MiniMax, Cline, Loomy, LobsterAI, Gemini, OpenCode) plus your own OpenAI/Anthropic-compatible upstreams into one model lane and a local gateway at 127.0.0.1:8330. One-click daily check-in, credit pools, fallback chains, usage dashboard.",
